## 🛠 Frameworks & Libraries Used

| Library | Version | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| [Bootstrap](https://getbootstrap.com/) | 5.3.3 | Layout, components, responsiveness |
| [Bootstrap Icons](https://icons.getbootstrap.com/) | 1.11.3 | Iconography |
| [Chart.js](https://www.chartjs.org/) | 4.4.1 | Dashboard visualizations |
| Vanilla JavaScript (ES6) | — | Logic, DOM manipulation, localStorage |

**No build tools, no npm, no framework dependencies** — pure static files served via GitHub Pages.

