## Project Structure

bookhive/
├── index.html # Login / Register page
├── dashboard.html # Dashboard with charts
├── books.html # Book catalog with pagination
├── borrowings.html # Borrowing records table
├── contact.html # Contact Us page
├── README.md # Documentation
├── css/
│ └── style.css # Global stylesheet (soft purple aesthetic)
├── js/
│ ├── auth.js # Login / register logic
│ ├── books.js # Catalog, search, pagination, borrow modal
│ ├── borrowings.js # Records table, overdue detection, return
│ ├── common.js # Session, navbar, footer, shared utilities
│ └── dashboard.js # Dashboard stats + Chart.js
└── images/
├── slide1.jpg ... slide3.jpg # Background slideshow
└── [book covers].jpg # Book cover images

---

## Deployment (GitHub Pages)

1. Push all files to a GitHub repository
2. Go to **Settings → Pages**
3. Set **Source** to `main` branch, root folder
4. Your site will be live at `https://<username>.github.io/<repo>/`
5. Ensure `index.html` is at the root (it will be the login page)

